<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="Explore Gwalior's heritage, local food, music and artisans with a plan that fits your day.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#350d0e">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=heritage-5">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css">
</head>
<body class="heritage-app" data-user-id="<%= currentUser ? currentUser.id : 'guest' %>">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main class="heritage-main" id="home">
  <section class="heritage-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <div class="heritage-hero-art-img-wrap" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden;">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599831104325-508b98453e92?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2160&q=88" alt="Gwalior Fort & Man Singh Palace towering on sandstone cliff" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; filter: brightness(0.65) contrast(1.1);">
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(43,7,12,0.2) 0%, rgba(28,4,7,0.85) 100%);"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="heritage-hero-wash"></div>
    <div class="heritage-hero-content">
      <div class="heritage-eyebrow" data-i18n="home.eyebrow"><span>✳</span> UNESCO CITY OF MUSIC · MADHYA PRADESH, INDIA</div>
      <h1 id="hero-heading" data-i18n="home.title">Where history finds its harmony.</h1>
      <p data-i18n="home.description">Beyond the fortress walls, discover Gwalior's living culture—one beautiful moment at a time.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="hero-primary" href="#discover"><span data-i18n="home.discoverCta">Discover Gwalior</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="hero-secondary" href="#trip-planner"><span aria-hidden="true">▷</span><span data-i18n="home.planCta">Plan your visit</span></a>
        <a class="hero-secondary" href="/app" style="background: rgba(197, 155, 39, 0.22); border-color: #F3D279; color: #F3D279;"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Interactive 3D Experience</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-caption"><span>26°13′48″N&nbsp; 78°10′26″E</span><span>THE HEART OF MADHYA PRADESH</span></div>
    <div class="hero-index"><span>01</span> / 03 <i></i></div>
  </section>
  <section class="heritage-intro" id="discover">
    <span class="section-kicker">A CITY OF MANY STORIES</span>
    <div class="intro-columns"><h2>More than a<br><em>destination.</em></h2><div><p>From the ancient sandstone ramparts above the city to the sound of a sarod drifting through a historic courtyard, Gwalior rewards the curious.</p><a href="#places">EXPLORE THE CITY <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="heritage-stats"><div><strong>1,200<span>+</span></strong><small>YEARS OF HISTORY</small></div><div><strong>36</strong><small>CURATED PLACES</small></div><div><strong>01</strong><small>UNFORGETTABLE CITY</small></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="places-section" id="places">
    <div class="places-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">FIND YOUR GWALIOR</span><h2>Follow what <em>moves you.</em></h2></div><a href="#trip-planner">VIEW YOUR VISIT <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="heritage-place-grid">
      <a class="heritage-place-card place-fort" data-query="I want to explore Gwalior heritage and forts" href="#trip-planner"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599831104325-508b98453e92?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1050&amp;q=85" alt="Gwalior Fort rising above the city"><span class="place-card-index">01 / HERITAGE</span><span class="place-card-copy"><small>STAND ABOVE IT ALL</small><strong>The Fort &amp; its<br>stories</strong><i>EXPLORE THE LANDMARK&nbsp; ↗</i></span></a>
      <a class="heritage-place-card place-music" data-query="I want to explore Tansen's classical music heritage" href="#trip-planner"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516280440614-37939bbacd81?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=85" alt="Musician performing Indian classical music"><span class="place-card-index">02 / MUSIC</span><span class="place-card-copy"><small>LISTEN A LITTLE CLOSER</small><strong>A city in<br>raag</strong><i>HEAR THE CITY&nbsp; ↗</i></span></a>
      <a class="heritage-place-card place-craft" data-query="I want to meet Gwalior craft and textile artisans" href="#trip-planner"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606760227091-3dd870d97f1d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=85" alt="Artisan's hands at work on a traditional craft"><span class="place-card-index">03 / LIVING CULTURE</span><span class="place-card-copy"><small>MADE HERE, BY HAND</small><strong>Meet the<br>makers</strong><i>MEET LOCAL ARTISANS&nbsp; ↗</i></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="heritage-planner" id="trip-planner">
    <div class="planner-heading"><span class="section-kicker">YOUR DAY, WELL SPENT</span><h2>Make room for<br><em>the unexpected.</em></h2><p>Tell us what you love. We’ll help you discover places that fit your day, with time to get back when you need to.</p><div class="planner-trust"><span>✳</span> CURATED PLACES&nbsp; · &nbsp;PRACTICAL TIMINGS&nbsp; · &nbsp;ROOM TO WANDER</div></div>
    <div class="container planner-container">

    <!-- Bento Grid Layout -->
    <div class="bento-grid">

      <!-- Primary Search Card (Span 8) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-8" style="grid-column: span 12;" id="trip-form-card">
        <h2>Plan your visit</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;">Choose your real start and destination. Your location is only requested when you press the location button.</p>

        <form action="/search" method="POST" class="search-form" id="planForm">
          <input type="hidden" name="city" value="Gwalior">
          <input type="hidden" name="companion" id="companionInput" value="solo">
          <input type="hidden" name="transit_mode" id="transitModeInput" value="auto">

          <section class="location-picker" aria-labelledby="locationPickerTitle">
            <div class="location-picker-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker" data-i18n="planner.journey">YOUR JOURNEY</span><h3 id="locationPickerTitle" data-i18n="planner.where">Where are you starting and ending?</h3></div><p>We use these points to route the whole trip, including the final leg.</p></div>
            <p class="location-privacy-note">One-time location only. Browser permission is requested after you choose it; we do not track continuously. Precise coordinates are used to calculate your itinerary and kept in this tab’s session storage.</p>
            <div class="location-choice-grid">
              <fieldset class="location-choice" id="startLocationPanel"><legend>Starting point</legend><output id="startLocationSummary" class="location-summary">No start selected</output><div class="location-actions"><button class="chip" type="button" data-geolocate="start">Use my current location</button><button class="chip active" type="button" data-map-target="start" aria-pressed="true">Choose on map</button><button class="chip" type="button" data-clear-location="start">Clear</button></div></fieldset>
              <fieldset class="location-choice" id="endLocationPanel"><legend>Destination / ending point</legend><output id="endLocationSummary" class="location-summary">Return to start selected</output><div class="location-actions"><button class="chip active" type="button" data-map-target="end" aria-pressed="false">Choose on map</button><button class="chip" type="button" data-clear-location="end">Clear</button></div></fieldset>
            </div>
            <label class="return-start-control"><input id="returnToStartInput" type="checkbox" checked> <span data-i18n="planner.returnStart">Return to my starting point</span></label>
            <details class="coordinate-entry"><summary>Enter coordinates manually</summary><div class="coordinate-grid"><label>Start label<input id="startLabelInput" class="query-input" maxlength="200" placeholder="Place name"></label><label>Latitude<input id="startLatInput" class="query-input" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="-90" max="90" step="any" placeholder="-90 to 90"></label><label>Longitude<input id="startLngInput" class="query-input" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="any" placeholder="-180 to 180"></label><label>End label<input id="endLabelInput" class="query-input" maxlength="200" placeholder="Place name"></label><label>Latitude<input id="endLatInput" class="query-input" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="-90" max="90" step="any" placeholder="-90 to 90"></label><label>Longitude<input id="endLngInput" class="query-input" inputmode="decimal" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="any" placeholder="-180 to 180"></label></div><p class="location-privacy-note">Address lookup is not configured in this project. A typed place name alone stays unresolved; select its map point or enter its coordinates.</p><button type="button" class="chip" id="applyCoordinatesButton">Use entered coordinates</button></details>
            <p id="locationPickerMessage" class="location-picker-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">Select which point to place, then click the map. Map tiles are provided by OpenStreetMap.</p>
            <div id="locationPickerMap" class="location-picker-map" role="region" aria-label="Map to choose start and destination pins"></div>
          </section>

          <div class="input-group">
            <label for="queryInput" data-i18n="planner.interests">What would you like to experience?</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="queryInput"
              name="query"
              class="query-input"
              placeholder="For example: I’d like to try local food and meet a craftsperson"
              data-i18n-placeholder="planner.queryPlaceholder"
              value=""
              aria-describedby="selectedInterests"
            >
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Category Chips -->
          <div class="chips-container interest-options" style="margin-bottom: 8px;" aria-label="Select one or more interests">
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Local food" aria-pressed="false">🍲 Local food</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Silk weaving" aria-pressed="false">🧵 Silk weaving</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Music heritage" aria-pressed="false">🎵 Music heritage</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Jewellery crafts" aria-pressed="false">💍 Jewellery crafts</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Heritage sites" aria-pressed="false">🏛 Heritage sites</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Nature" aria-pressed="false">🌿 Nature</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-interest="Shopping" aria-pressed="false">🛍 Shopping</button>
          </div>
          <p id="selectedInterests" class="selection-summary" aria-live="polite">Selected interests: none yet</p>

          <!-- Companion Selector -->
          <div style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <div class="choice-label" id="companionLabel">Who’s coming with you?</div>
            <div id="companionChips" class="chip-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="companionLabel">
              <button type="button" class="chip active" data-value="solo" aria-pressed="true">👤 Just me</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="couple" aria-pressed="false">👫 Two people</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="family" aria-pressed="false">👨‍👩‍👧 Family with children</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="group" aria-pressed="false">👥 Group</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Urban Transit Mode Selector -->
          <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div class="choice-label" id="transitModeLabel">How would you like to get around?</div>
            <div id="transitModeChips" class="chip-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="transitModeLabel">
              <button type="button" class="chip active" data-value="auto" aria-pressed="true">🛺 Auto-rickshaw</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="e_rickshaw" aria-pressed="false">⚡ E-rickshaw</button>
              <button type="button" class="chip" data-value="cab" aria-pressed="false">🚕 Cab</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="input-group" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <label for="visitDateInput" data-i18n="planner.date">Visit date</label>
            <input type="date" id="visitDateInput" name="date" class="query-input" value="" required>
          </div>

          <p id="tripSelectionSummary" class="selection-summary" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <p id="formError" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>

          <!-- Start Time and Hard Return Deadline Inputs -->
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div class="input-group" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <label for="startTimeInput" data-i18n="planner.startTime">Start time</label>
              <input
                type="time"
                id="startTimeInput"
                name="start_time"
                class="query-input"
                value="10:00"
                required
              >
            </div>
            <div class="input-group" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <label for="deadlineInput" data-i18n="planner.deadline">I need to be back by</label>
              <input
                type="time"
                id="deadlineInput"
                name="deadline"
                class="query-input"
                value="18:00"
                required
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="input-group" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <label for="budgetInput" data-i18n="planner.budget">Budget limit (optional, INR)</label>
            <input type="number" id="budgetInput" name="budget" class="query-input" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Leave blank for no budget filter">
          </div>

          <!-- Time Budget Slider -->
          <div class="slider-container">
            <div class="slider-header">
              <label for="timeBudgetSlider" style="margin: 0;" data-i18n="planner.available">How much time do you have?</label>
              <div id="sliderDisplay" class="slider-value">6 hours</div>
            </div>
            <input
              type="range"
              id="timeBudgetSlider"
              name="time_budget_hours"
              min="1.0"
              max="8.0"
              step="0.5"
              value="6.0"
            >
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <span>1 hour</span>
              <span>4 hours</span>
              <span>8 hours</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" id="buildItineraryButton" data-i18n-aria-label="planner.build">
            <span data-i18n="planner.build">Build my itinerary</span>
          </button>
          <div id="agentProgress" class="agent-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>
            <span id="agentProgressIcon" class="agent-progress-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
            <div class="agent-progress-copy">
              <p id="agentProgressAgent" class="agent-progress-agent">Manager Agent</p>
              <p id="agentProgressMessage" class="agent-progress-message">Understanding your travel preferences…</p>
              <div id="agentProgressTrack" class="agent-progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Planning animation progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0">
                <span id="agentProgressFill" class="agent-progress-fill"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span id="agentProgressPercent" class="agent-progress-percent">0%</span>
          </div>
        </form>
        <section id="planResult" class="plan-result" aria-live="polite" hidden></section>
      </div>

      <!-- Feasibility Architecture Card (Span 4) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-4 planner-expectation" style="display:none;">
        <div class="pill-badge" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span>🧭 A realistic plan</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Plan with breathing room</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Your suggestions fit the time you have, including travel between places and time to explore.
        </p>

        <div style="background: #1E293B; color: #F8FAFC; padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Travel time + time to explore + a little extra time
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--accent-coral-light); border: 1px solid #FECDD3; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #991B1B;">
          <strong>We leave a 25% time cushion</strong> for a more comfortable day. Travel estimates use typical speeds and do not include live traffic.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visitor-focused explanation -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-col-12" style="display:none;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <h2>What to expect</h2>
          <div class="pill-badge green">
            <span><%= poiCount %> places in our Gwalior guide</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
          <div class="expectation-card">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 6px;">1. Tell us what you like</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              Food, music, crafts, or a mix. You can write in English or Hindi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="expectation-card">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-coral); margin-bottom: 6px;">2. Choose your time</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              Set when you start, when you need to return, and how you’ll travel.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="expectation-card">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-green); margin-bottom: 6px;">3. Get a visit plan</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              We’ll suggest places from our local guide and show estimated travel and visit times.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    </div>
  </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="heritage-footer" style="padding: 40px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197, 155, 39, 0.3); background: #1C0407; color: #FDFBF7; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px;">
    <a class="heritage-brand" href="#home" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: #FDFBF7;">
      <span class="brand-crest" aria-hidden="true" style="color: #F3D279; font-size: 24px;">♜</span>
      <span><strong style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; display: block;">Beyond the Fort</strong><small style="color: #F3D279; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">UNESCO City of Music · Gwalior, India</small></span>
    </a>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #d6cfc7; max-width: 480px; text-align: center;">
      100% Free Public Digital Discoverability Platform. Calibrated with verified ASI operating hours and deterministic +25% transit safety buffer.
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #a89f91;">
      © 2026 Beyond the Fort · Made for the curious traveler
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/agentProgress.js?v=planner-agents-1"></script>
  <script src="/js/i18n.js?v=nav-i18n-1"></script><script src="/js/main.js?v=planner-agents-1"></script>
</body>
</html>
